		{
			dependencies: ["31DEFF7A83AD87ED"]
			description: [
				"&bThe autumn fog carries more than damp cold.&r"
				"&bSometimes the trees stand a little too straight.&r"
				"&bSometimes you will find torches burning without fuel, or shrines of dirt where none was built.&r"
				""
				"&cShould you glimpse a figure standing motionless at render distance:&r"
				"  • &eDo not pursue.&r It does not wish to be caught."
